  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">Mary/Undying 的库<br><br>用于：<br><br></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">Boss 实体&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">实体渲染</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">物品渲染&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">更多&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br><br>包含一些实用道具：<br><br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">击退棒&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">实体消失法杖</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">实体眩晕道具&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">更多&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br><br>以及一些命令：<br><br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">列出 Mixins&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">移除实体&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">添加镜头震动</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">强制添加效果<br><br><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pAJ4hnVUuf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&lt;Discord 服务器&gt;</a></span></li>\n</ul>",
